      id: "two-awards",
      prompt: "Read two ints, default 0. Print score and their sum.",
      starter: "#include <iostream>\nint main() {\n  std::cout << \"score 1\\n\";\n  return 0;\n}\n",
      solution: "#include <iostream>\nint main() {\n  int a = 0;\n  int b = 0;\n  std::cin >> a >> b;\n  std::cout << \"score \" << (a + b) << \"\\n\";\n  return 0;\n}\n",
      hints: ["A missing second int stays 0.", "Add, then print once."],
